  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "NEW\n\t\t\t* Nodes<T>(): a project's or a file's syntax nodes of one kind, each named by its file and line\n\t\t\t* SourceSpan.Lines: the lines a span covers\n\t\t\t* A member's Gives and Takes: the types its return type and its parameters' types name, or whether one is of a kind, is a type or meets a condition\n\t\t\t* A file's DependsOn: the projects and packages whose types its code uses, as the rules name them\n\t\t\t* A file's Model: the compiler's view of its syntax\n\t\t\t* AllTypes on a project or a file: its types with those nested in them\n\t\t\t* A member's IsOriginal: whether it sets its own name and signature, neither implementing nor overriding\n\t\t\t* A file's Folder, Name and Extension\n\t\t\tCHANGED\n\t\t\t* Requires TSpec 5.4.0 or later\n\t\t\tOBSOLETE\n\t\t\t* OpensInternalsTo: TSpec's own SourceProject.OpensInternalsTo takes its place, read without Roslyn",
